WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:08.445
Sushi Train is a card drafting game for two to eight players. You're at a sushi conveyor, trying to put together the best meal.

2
00:00:09.145 --> 00:00:18.336
Everybody secretly picks one card from their hand, then all hands are passed to the left. Pick again, pass again, until the cards run out.

3
00:00:18.486 --> 00:00:20.720
That's one round, and you play three.

4
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:33.470
Different dishes score in different ways. Two tempura are worth five. Three sashimi, ten. Dumplings get better the more you collect, and nigiri is worth more on top of a wasabi.

5
00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:38.391
Whoever has the most maki rolls takes six points, and second place takes three.

6
00:00:39.091 --> 00:00:48.618
Chopsticks let you pick two cards on a later turn. And pudding is kept across all three rounds. Most puddings get a bonus, and fewest get a penalty.

7
00:00:48.768 --> 00:00:54.133
Watch what's left in the hand you receive. It tells you what everybody else is collecting.
